        <owl:versionInfo xml:lang="en">stable</owl:versionInfo>
        <ns1:iccdNormTag>Normativa trasversale: CD/ESC, CD/EPR, CD/ECP CM/CMP/CMPN, CM/CMC, CM/CMR, CM/RSR, CM/FUR, CM/RVM/RVMN, RVME, CM/AGG/AGGN, AGGR,AGGE, AGGF, AC/ACS/ACSE; RO/ROF/ROFA, RO/COP/COPA, RO/CRF/CRFN, CRFB, RO/ADL/ADLA, ADLE; TU/ACQ/ACQN, DO/DCM/DCMA, DCME, DO/FTA/FTAA, FTAE, DO/DRA/DRAA, DRAE; DO/VDC/VDCR, VDCE, DO/REG/REGA, REGE; DO/FNT/FNTA, FNTN, FNTE, DO/ADM/ADMA, ADME, DO/CTF/CTFC, DO/BIB/BIBA, DO/BSE/BSEA, TU/CDG/CDGS, TU/ESP/ESPU, TU/NVC/NVCA, TU/STU/STUE, RE/IND/INDE, INDR, INDN, RE/RCG/RCGA, RCGR, RCGF, RCGJ, RE/DSC/DSCA, DSCF, DSCR, DSCJ; CM/ISP/ISPN; */ALB/ALBO, ALBE; */FOI/FOIS, FOIE, FOIR, RE/AIN/AINR; AU/DDC/DDCN, DDCM; TU/CPR/CPRN, DA/AUE/AUEE, AUEZ, AUES, DA/ZEC, AU/EDT/EDTN, EDTA, EDTZ; UT/UTN, UT/UTN/UTNN, AU/FRU/FRUN, */ACC/ACCE. UB/INP/INPE; AU/CMM/CMMN, CMME; */RST/RSTE, RSTR, RSTN; CON/CONA, CON/CONZ; MS/MST/MSTE, MSTO; MS/PRM/PRME; UB/COL/COLN. Normativa SCAN: BI/RIL/RILR, RILA. Normativa BDI: DR/DRV/DRVE, DRVR, DR/DRV, DRL, DRO, DRG, DRF, DRR; DU/DUY/DUYN, DU/DUX/DUXE, DUXC, DU/DUZ/DUZS, DU/DUQ/DUQN; DV/DVY/DVYN, DV/DVX/DVXE, DVXC, DV/DVZ/DVZS, DV/DVQ/DVQN; DF/DFY/DFYN, DF/DFX/DFXE, DFXC, DF/DFZ/DFZS, DF/DFQ/DFQN; AI/AIY/AIYN, AI/AIX/AIXE, AIXC, AI/AIZ/AIZS, AI/AIQ/AIQN, AI/AIF/AIFN, AI/AIE/AIED; VI/VIY/VIYN, VI/VIX/VIXE, VIXC, VI/VIZ/VIZS, VI/VIQ/VIQN, VI/VIF/VIFN, VI/VIE/VIED; FI/FIY/FIYN, FI/FIX/FIXE, FIXC, FI/FIZ/FIZS, FI/FIQ/FIQN, FI/FIF/FIFN, FI/FIE/FIED. Normativa SM: CL/CLA/CLAA. Normativa BNB: SB/NAA/NAAG, NAAI, NAAE, NAAC, SB/NAT/NATG, NATI, NATE, NATC, RB/RBR/RBNG, RBNI, RBNE, RBNC, LR/LRD/LRDA, DB/DBR/DBRA, DB/DBC/DBCA, DB/DBX/DBXT, DB/DBP/DBPA, DB/DBS/DBSR. Normativa BNM: LR/LRI/LRIL, LRIZ, LRIG, LRIX,. Normativa BNP: SP/SPS/SPSA, SPSD. Normativa BNZ: SZ/SZS/SZSE, SZSD. Normativa ATOG/OGS/OGSA, IN/INI/INIL, INIO. Normativa BNPL: SP/SPN/SPNS, SPNM. Versioni 4.00 e ICCD Normativa Trasversale: MS/MST/MSTE - Versioni precedenti a 4.00: DO/MST/MSTO</ns1:iccdNormTag>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


