        <ns1:iccdNormTag>Normativa trasversale: CD/NTC, AC/ACC, ACI, ACS/ACSC, AC/MOD/MODI; OG/OGT/OGTI; RO/ROF/ROFX, RO/CRF/CRFH, DO/BIB/BIBH, BIBK, NCUN, RE/RCG/RCGK, NCUN, NUCN, RCGH, RE/DSC/DSCK, NUCN, NCUN, DSCH, RE/FOI/FOID; AU/AUT/AUTH, AUTK, NUCN, NCUN; AU/AUF/AUFH, NUCN, NCUN; PD/PDF/PDFH; UB/INP/INPS: LC/LDC/LDCK, LDCG; LA/PRC/PRCK; MC/CMN/CMNN. MODI: CD/CDR, CDM. Normativa BDI: DU/DUC, DU/DUO/DUOC, DU/DUM/DUMC, DV/DVC, DV/DVO/DVOC, DV/DVM/DVMC, DF/DFC, DF/DFO/DFOC, DF/DFM/DFMC, AI/AIC, AI/AIO/AIOC, AI/AIM/AIMC, VI/VIC, VI/VIO/VIOC, VI/VIM/VIMC, FI/FIC, FI/FIO/FIOC, FI/FIM/FIMC</ns1:iccdNormTag>
    </owl:Class>
    


